{"assumptions":["There is no existing code, so every requirement is ADDED. Endpoint paths in acceptance criteria only show the contract.","ASM-24 (Stripe card payments) conflicts with request section 32 (no online card payments in this phase). The spec follows the request: staff record payment manually with a payment date and the recording user.","Rejection HTTP status codes differ between drafts (e.g. 400 vs 410 for expired links, 400 vs 422 vs 409 for validation errors, 202 vs 200 for reset requests). d3 states codes are examples; the merged ACs use one code where drafts agree on the outcome, and the fixed rule is success or rejection with no record change on rejection.","The pending invitation status is called \"Pending\" (d1/d2) or \"Invited\" (d3); these are the same state.","An ERP file fails validation as a whole if it is missing, unreadable, empty, missing a required column, or has any non-numeric or negative quantity. Unknown product identifiers alone do not fail the file (ASM-6).","Stock import rows are matched by distributor product code until the client supplies the column layout (ASM-7). Products missing from a valid file keep their previous quantity; a product never imported counts as Out of stock.","Placing or confirming an order does not reduce imported stock; nothing is reserved.","Price or stock changes at checkout reject the submission and return current values; the order is never silently repriced.","Repeat order works for an order of any status and adds lines at their original quantity, capped at available stock and flagged when reduced.","Order and basket totals are net (tax-exclusive); tax and gross appear only on invoices (ASM-9). One currency with 2 decimal places.","A deactivated price list cannot be newly assigned. If a company has no assigned or an inactive price list, every product shows 'Price on request' (d3).","Search is a case-insensitive substring match; ranking is not specified.","Vehicle compatibility entries store a model-year range (from–to) (d1); d3 says model year.","Confirmation validation means every line is active and within available stock and the delivery address still exists.","A password reset request returns the same response whether or not the email exists.","The stock quantity limit (ASM-4) applies to Buyer baskets, staff-created order lines and staff amendments.","Staff removing an order line counts as a quantity change to 0 and triggers the amendment email (ASM-35). Staff cannot add new lines to Received orders.","Product images may be JPEG, PNG or WebP; ASM-29 sets the 10 MB limit.","Delivery list CSV columns are those in REQ-64 until the client confirms them.","The invoice date is the date the order became Delivered.","Management has no separate role; managers use Office Staff or Administrator accounts for the sales report.","Reactivating a user is allowed only while the user's company is active (d3 reading of 'where permitted').","Session idle timeout values are draft assumptions; the request only says 'session management'."],"nfrs":[{"id":"NFR-1","metric":"p95 response time ≤ 1.5 s with 50,000 active products and 100 concurrent signed-in users","text":"Catalogue search, category filter and vehicle search respond within a bounded time under load."},{"id":"NFR-3","metric":"p95 response time ≤ 2.0 s at 100 concurrent users","text":"Basket, checkout, order and invoice endpoints respond within a bounded time (d1/d3 load)."},{"id":"NFR-4","metric":"p95 response time ≤ 2.0 s at 200 concurrent users","text":"Basket, checkout, order and invoice endpoints respond within a bounded time (d2 load)."},{"id":"NFR-5","metric":"A 100,000-row CSV is validated and applied in ≤ 15 minutes","text":"The nightly ERP stock import completes within its window (d1)."},{"id":"NFR-6","metric":"A 50,000-row CSV imports in ≤ 10 minutes","text":"The nightly ERP stock import finishes before business hours (d2)."},{"id":"NFR-7","metric":"A 100,000-row CSV imports in ≤ 10 minutes","text":"The nightly ERP stock import finishes within the stated time (d3)."},{"id":"NFR-8","metric":"≥ 99% of emails handed off within 5 minutes of the triggering event","text":"Order, reset and account emails are handed to the email service promptly (d1/d2)."},{"id":"NFR-9","metric":"≥ 99% of emails handed off within 2 minutes of the triggering event","text":"Order and account emails are handed to the email service promptly (d3)."},{"id":"NFR-10","metric":"Argon2id or bcrypt with cost ≥ 12; 0 plaintext or reversibly encrypted passwords in storage or log scan","text":"Passwords are stored only as salted adaptive one-way hashes and never written to logs."},{"id":"NFR-11","metric":"100% of endpoints served over TLS 1.2 or higher; 0 plain-HTTP endpoints (HTTP requests redirected)","text":"All traffic is encrypted in transit."},{"id":"NFR-12","metric":"AES-256 encryption at rest for 100% of stored personal and order data","text":"All personal and order data is encrypted at rest."},{"id":"NFR-13","metric":"0 records of another company returned in a suite covering 100% of Buyer-accessible endpoints","text":"Cross-company data isolation for Buyers is verified by automated authorisation tests."},{"id":"NFR-14","metric":"0 outbound write calls to ERP systems or the ERP drop location (other than moving processed files)","text":"The portal treats ERP stock as read-only."},{"id":"NFR-15","metric":"Session token rejected after 30 minutes without a request; absolute lifetime 12 hours","text":"Sessions expire after inactivity and after a maximum lifetime."},{"id":"NFR-17","metric":"≥ 99.5% monthly uptime excluding announced maintenance; maintenance ≤ 4 hours per month (d3)","text":"Availability of the portal."},{"id":"NFR-18","metric":"All Buyer and staff screens usable without horizontal scrolling at viewport widths 360–1920 px in the latest 2 versions of Chrome, Edge, Firefox and Safari","text":"Responsive web app on desktop and mobile browsers."},{"id":"NFR-19","metric":"p95 ≤ 5 s for an invoice with up to 200 lines","text":"Invoice PDF generation time."},{"id":"NFR-20","metric":"≥ 128 bits of entropy per token; 0 tokens stored in plaintext","text":"Password-reset and invitation tokens are unguessable and stored hashed."},{"id":"NFR-21","metric":"Daily backups; RPO ≤ 24 hours; RTO ≤ 8 hours","text":"Data backup and recovery within one cloud region in the client's account."}],"outOfScope":["Customer Account Manager role (Q-1)","Saved basket templates, request section 16 (ASM-1)","Buyers creating or editing their own delivery addresses (Q-7, ASM-13)","Basket persistence across sessions (ASM-14)","Nested categories (ASM-15)","Separate Rejected order status; rejection uses Cancelled with a reason (ASM-16)","SMS and push notifications (ASM-17, ASM-18)","Full field-level audit trail beyond created/last-changed by and at, status timeline and amendment records (ASM-21)","Custom report builder (ASM-20)","Migration of existing customer, product, price or vehicle data; system starts empty with seed data (ASM-22)","CSV upload of vehicle compatibility data (ASM-23)","Native mobile apps (ASM-30)","Languages other than English (ASM-10)","Backorders and ordering above imported stock (request section 8; ASM-4)","Online card payments, any payment-provider integration, partial payments and payment-method capture (request section 32; overrides ASM-24)","Route planning (request section 22)","Volume, promotional, discount and date-effective pricing (request section 10: one price per product per price list)","Any modification of or writing back to ERP stock or orders (request section 9)","Reproducing an existing client invoice template (ASM-26)"],"requirements":[{"acceptance":[{"given":"An active Buyer account buyer@a.test with a known password, linked to an active company","id":"AC-1.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the response contains a session token and the role value \"Buyer\"","when":"POST /auth/sign-in with that email and password"},{"given":"The session 