t user's sign-in attempts and every request, including order submission, made with that user's existing sessions.","id":"REQ-4","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-17","Q-5"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A user with a valid session token","id":"AC-5.1","level":"api","then":"The sign-out response status is a success status (200 or 204) and the GET /orders response status is 401","when":"The user calls POST /auth/sign-out and then requests GET /orders with the same token"}],"ears":"When a signed-in user signs out, the portal shall invalidate that user's session token.","id":"REQ-5","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"No session token","id":"AC-6.1","level":"api","then":"Each response status is 401 and no product, order or invoice data is returned","when":"GET the catalogue, the order list, an order, the invoice list and an invoice PDF"}],"ears":"If a request to any endpoint other than sign-in, password reset and invitation acceptance carries no valid session token, then the portal shall reject it with status 401 without returning any record data.","id":"REQ-6","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A signed-in Buyer","id":"AC-7.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 403","when":"The Buyer requests the staff order queue"},{"given":"A signed-in Office Staff user","id":"AC-7.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 403 and no price list record is created","when":"The user POSTs a new price list"},{"given":"A signed-in Office Staff user","id":"AC-7.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 403 and no product row is created","when":"POST /admin/products is called with a valid product"},{"given":"A signed-in Administrator and an order in status Received","id":"AC-7.4","level":"api","then":"Both response statuses are 200 and the order record status value is \"Confirmed\"","when":"The Administrator requests the staff order queue and then confirms the order"}],"ears":"If a user calls an endpoint outside the capabilities of their role (Buyer, Office Staff or Administrator, where Administrator includes every Office Staff capability), then the portal shall reject the request with status 403.","id":"REQ-7","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-9","I-6","I-17","Q-1","ASM-28"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Buyer A of company A and order ORD-000200 of company B","id":"AC-8.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 404 and no order data is returned","when":"Buyer A requests ORD-000200"},{"given":"Company B has invoice INV-000050","id":"AC-8.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 404 and no file is returned","when":"Buyer A requests the PDF of INV-000050"},{"given":"Company A has 3 orders (2 by Buyer A, 1 by colleague Buyer A2) and company B has 2 orders","id":"AC-8.3","level":"api","then":"The returned list contains exactly the 3 company A orders","when":"Buyer A lists orders"},{"given":"Company B has a delivery address and a price list different from company A","id":"AC-8.4","level":"api","then":"The returned address list contains only company A addresses and the returned price value comes from company A's price list","when":"Buyer A lists delivery addresses and opens a product"}],"ears":"While a Buyer is signed in, the portal shall return only orders, invoices, prices, delivery addresses and account data that belong to the Buyer's own customer company and respond with status 404 to requests for such records of another company.","id":"REQ-8","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-5","I-9","Q-2"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An account exists for buyer@a.test","id":"AC-9.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 202 and exactly one email containing a reset link is sent to buyer@a.test","when":"POST a password reset request for buyer@a.test"},{"given":"No account exists for ghost@x.test","id":"AC-9.2","level":"api","then":"The response status and body equal those of AC-9.1 and no email is sent","when":"POST a password reset re