r listed fields","when":"A Buyer opens the product"},{"given":"An active product with imported quantity 0","id":"AC-24.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the stockStatus value is \"Out of stock\"","when":"A Buyer opens the product"},{"given":"A retired product","id":"AC-24.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 404","when":"A Buyer opens the product"}],"ears":"When a Buyer opens an active product, the portal shall return its image, name, product code, manufacturer, description, unit, pack size, the Buyer's price, stock status and compatible vehicles.","id":"REQ-24","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-2","I-3","I-10"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product X costs 50.00 on Standard and 40.00 on Workshop A, and company A is assigned Workshop A","id":"AC-25.1","level":"api","then":"The returned price value is 40.00 and the value 50.00 does not appear in the response","when":"A Buyer of company A opens product X"},{"given":"The setup of AC-25.1","id":"AC-25.2","level":"api","then":"The returned price value is 50.00","when":"An administrator assigns Standard to company A and the Buyer opens product X again"},{"given":"Product BP-1001 priced 15.00 on Standard and 12.50 on Workshop A; company A on Workshop A and company B on Standard","id":"AC-25.3","level":"api","then":"The price value returned to company A's Buyer is 12.50 and to company B's Buyer is 15.00","when":"A Buyer of each company opens BP-1001"}],"ears":"The portal shall price every product shown to a Buyer, and every line added to that company's basket, staff-created orders and repeat orders, from the price list assigned to the Buyer's customer company at the time of the request, so that a changed assignment applies from then on.","id":"REQ-25","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-11","I-17"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A is assigned Workshop A with BP-1001 = 12.50 and a signed-in Office Staff user","id":"AC-26.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and