sponse status is 422 and the company's assigned price list value is unchanged","when":"The administrator assigns it to a customer company"}],"ears":"The portal shall let administrators create, rename and deactivate price lists, set, edit and remove at most one price per product on a price list, and assign an active price list to a customer company.","id":"REQ-28","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-11","I-17"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Order ORD-000101 has a line for product X at unit price 40.00","id":"AC-29.1","level":"api","then":"The returned unit price value on the order line is 40.00","when":"The administrator changes product X to 45.00 on that price list and the order is opened"},{"given":"Order ORD-000124 with BP-1001 at 12.50 for company A","id":"AC-29.2","level":"api","then":"The returned line unit price is 12.50 and the order total value is unchanged","when":"An administrator reassigns company A to Standard and the Buyer opens ORD-000124"}],"ears":"When a price on a price list is changed or a company's price list assignment changes, the portal shall leave the unit prices stored on existing orders and invoices unchanged.","id":"REQ-29","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-11","I-13"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Low-stock threshold 5","id":"AC-30.1","level":"unit","then":"The returned values are Out of stock, Low stock, Low stock and In stock","when":"The stock-status calculator is called with quantities 0, 1, 5 and 6"},{"given":"Low-stock threshold 5","id":"AC-30.2","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is Out of stock","when":"The stock-status calculator is called for a product with no imported quantity"}],"ears":"The portal shall derive each product's stock status as Out of stock when its imported quantity is 0 or less or it has never been imported, Low stock when the quantity is from 1 up to the configured low-stock threshold, and In stock when the quantity is above that threshold.","id":"REQ-30","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-12","ASM-5"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Threshold 10, products BP-1001 (quantity 4) and FL-200 (quantity 0) and a valid CSV listing BP-1001=25 and FL-200=3","id":"AC-31.1","level":"job","then":"The BP-1001 row has quantity 25 and status \"In stock\", the FL-200 row has quantity 3 and status \"Low stock\", and an import log record has status \"Success\" with rows-applied count 2","when":"The stock import job runs"},{"given":"No new file in the configured location since the last run","id":"AC-31.2","level":"job","then":"No stock quantity value changes","when":"The stock import job runs"}],"ears":"When the scheduled stock import finds a new ERP CSV file in the configured location that passes file validation, the portal shall replace the stored quantity and recalculate the stock status of each listed known product and record a successful import log entry with row counts.","id":"REQ-31","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","I-3","ASM-7"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A valid CSV with BP-100=12 and ZZ-999=5, where ZZ-999 is not a known product","id":"AC-32.1","level":"job","then":"BP-100's stored quantity value is 12 and the import log row has status \"Success\", rows-applied count 1 and ZZ-999 in its skipped-identifiers list","when":"The stock import job runs"}],"ears":"If a valid ERP CSV contains rows with unknown product identifiers, then the portal shall skip those rows, apply the other rows and list the unknown identifiers in the import log entry.","id":"REQ-32","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","ASM-6"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Stored quantity BP-100=12 and a CSV missing the quantity column","id":"AC-33.1","level":"job","then":"BP-100's stored quantity value is still 12 and an import log row has status \"Failed\" and a reason naming the missing column","when":"The stock import job runs"},{"given":"Stored quantity BP-100=12 and a CSV where one row has quantity \"abc\" and another has BP-100=20","id":"AC-33.2","level":"job","then":"BP-100's stored quantity value is still 12 and the import log row has status \"Failed\" with a reason naming the bad row","when":"The stock import job runs"},{"given":"An empty CSV file","id":"AC-33.3","level":"job","then":"No stored quantity value changes and the import log row has status \"Failed\"","when":"The stock import job runs"},{"given":"No CSV file is present at the configured location","id":"AC-33.4","level":"job","then":"An import log record has status \"Failed\" with reason \"file missing\" and no stock row changes","when":"The stock import job runs"}],"ears":"If the ERP CSV file is missing, unreadable, empty, lacks a required column or contains a non-numeric or negative quantity, then the portal shall keep every previous stock quantity unchanged and record a failed import log entry with the failure reason.","id":"REQ-33","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"One successful and one failed import","id":"AC-34.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned list has 2 rows with time, status, rowsApplied, skippedIdentifiers and failureReason fields","when":"A staff user lists stock imports"},{"given":"A signed-in Buyer","id":"AC-34.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 403","when":"The Buyer lists stock imports"}],"ears":"When a staff user or administrator lists stock imports, the portal shall return each import's time, status, rows-applied count, skipped identifiers and failure reason.","id":"REQ-34","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12","I-6"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Outbound traffic to the ERP host is recorded and the ERP CSV file checksum is noted","id":"AC-35.1","level":"job","then":"No outbound call to the ERP host is recorded and the CSV file checksum value is unchanged","when":"The stock import job runs and a Buyer submits an order"}],"ears":"The portal shall not send any create, update or delete request to the ERP system.","id":"REQ-35","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-12"],"stability":0.3333333333333333},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product X with quantity 7 and prices on Standard and Workshop A","id":"AC-36.1","level":"api","then":"The returned quantity value is 7 and the returned price list has 2 entries","when":"A staff user opens product X"},{"given":"Product P imported with quantity 30 at 02:00","id":"AC-36.2","level":"api","then":"The response contains quantity 30, status \"In stock\" and last import time 02:00","when":"A staff user requests the stock of P"}],"ears":"When a staff user opens a product, the portal shall return its imported stock quantity, stock status, the time of the last successful import and its price on each price list.","id":"REQ-36","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-6","I-11","I-12"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Product BP-100 with imported quantity 10","id":"AC-37.1","level":"api","then":"The response is a rejection status (422/400), the error message states 10 available and the line quantity value stays at its previous value","when":"A Buyer sets the basket quantity to 11"},{"given":"The same product","id":"AC-37.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the returned line quantity is 10","when":"A Buyer sets the basket quantity to 10"},{"given":"Product FL-200 with imported quantity 0","id":"AC-37.3","level":"api","then":"The response is a rejection status and the basket list does not contain FL-200","when":"A Buyer adds FL-200 quantity 1 to the basket"},{"given":"Product OF-20 with imported quantity 0","id":"AC-37.4","level":"api","then":"The response status is 422 and the error message says the product is out of stock","when":"A staff user adds 1 of OF-20 to an order being created for company A"}],"ears":"If a basket line, staff-created order line or staff amendment would set a quantity greater than the product's imported stock quantity, or the product is Out of stock, then the portal shall reject the change with an error stating the available quantity.","id":"REQ-37","op":"ADDED","sources":["