nd the following Tuesday","when":"The calculator is called with Friday 13:00 and Friday 15:00"},{"given":"Cutoff 14:00 and Tuesday 6 Oct 2026 listed as a non-working date","id":"AC-39.3","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is Wednesday 7 Oct","when":"The calculator is called with Monday 5 Oct 13:00"},{"given":"Timezone Europe/London and cutoff 14:00","id":"AC-39.4","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is Tuesday","when":"The calculator is called with Monday 12:30 UTC during British Summer Time (13:30 local)"},{"given":"Timezone Europe/London and cutoff 14:00","id":"AC-39.5","level":"unit","then":"The returned value is Wednesday 7 Oct","when":"The calculator is called with Monday 5 Oct 2026 13:30 UTC (14:30 local)"}],"ears":"The portal shall calculate the earliest delivery date, in the configured timezone, as the next working day when the order time is before the configured cutoff (default 14:00) and as the working day after the next working day when the order time is at or after the cutoff, skipping configured non-working dates.","id":"REQ-39","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-11","ASM-36"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Maximum 14 days ahead, weekends non-working, current time Monday 10:00","id":"AC-40.1","level":"api","then":"The returned list starts with Tuesday, contains no Saturday or Sunday, and its last value is no later than 14 days after today","when":"A Buyer requests the selectable delivery dates"},{"given":"Now is Monday 2026-10-05 15:00, cutoff 14:00, maximum 30 days ahead","id":"AC-40.2","level":"api","then":"Each response is a validation error status with an error naming the date rule broken","when":"The Buyer sets the basket delivery date to 2026-10-06, 2026-10-10 (Saturday) and 2026-11-20 in turn"},{"given":"The settings of AC-40.2","id":"AC-40.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the basket delivery date field is 2026-10-07","when":"The Buyer sets the basket delivery date to 2026-10-07"},{"given":"A Buyer basket with delivery date Tuesday chosen at Monday 13:50","id":"AC-40.4","level":"api","then":"The response status is 422, the error names the deliveryDate field and no order record is created","when":"The Buyer submits the order at Monday 14:05"}],"ears":"The portal shall offer and accept as delivery dates, for Buyer and staff orders and checked again at submission time, only working days from the earliest delivery date up to the configured maximum number of days ahead, rejecting any other date with an error naming the delivery date.","id":"REQ-40","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","ASM-12"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Buyer of company A","id":"AC-41.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 422, the error names the deliveryAddress field and no order record is created","when":"The Buyer submits an order using a delivery address id of company B"},{"given":"Company A has addresses A1 and A2 and company B has address B1","id":"AC-41.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 422 and the basket delivery address field is unchanged","when":"A Buyer of company A sets the basket delivery address to B1"},{"given":"The data of AC-41.2","id":"AC-41.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the basket delivery address field is A2","when":"A Buyer of company A sets the basket delivery address to A2"}],"ears":"If a basket, submitted order or order edit is given a delivery address that does not belong to the order's customer company, then the portal shall reject it with an error naming the delivery address.","id":"REQ-41","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-13","Q-4","Q-7","ASM-13"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A basket with 5 of BP-100 when 12 were in stock, and a stock import then sets BP-100 to 3","id":"AC-42.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 409, the returned list of affected lines contains BP-100 with available quantity 3, and no order record is created","when":"The Buyer submits the order"},{"given":"A basket line for product X at 40.00, and the administrator then changes X to 42.00","id":"AC-42.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 409, the returned affected line shows current price 42.00 and no order record is created","when":"The Buyer submits the order"},{"given":"A basket line whose product was retired after it was added","id":"AC-42.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 409 and the response lists the line as unavailable","when":"The Buyer submits the order"}],"ears":"When a Buyer submits an order, the portal shall re-check every line's availability, stock limit and current company price and, if any line is unavailable, over stock or re-priced, reject the submission and list the affected lines with their current price and available quantity.","id":"REQ-42","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-3","I-13","ASM-4"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Buyer with a 2-line basket, a selected address, date and note","id":"AC-43.1","level":"manual","then":"A person checks that the review page is shown with every listed item matching the basket, with the submit button below them, and that the order is only created after pressing submit","when":"The Buyer proceeds to checkout in a browser"},{"given":"A basket with 2 lines, a chosen address, date and note 'Rear entrance'","id":"AC-43.2","level":"api","then":"The response contains both lines with prices and totals, the subtotal, the address, the date and the note value 'Rear entrance'","when":"GET /checkout/review is called"}],"ears":"When a Buyer proceeds to checkout, the portal shall display a final review page with the lines, quantities, unit prices, line totals, subtotal, delivery address, delivery date and note before the submit action.","id":"REQ-43","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-13"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Prefix ORD- and last order number ORD-000123","id":"AC-44.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 and the returned order has number ORD-000124, status Received, 2 lines with the basket unit prices, the address, the date, the note value and 1 timeline entry naming the Buyer","when":"A Buyer submits a valid basket with 2 lines and note \"Leave at rear gate\""},{"given":"The order from AC-44.1","id":"AC-44.2","level":"api","then":"The queue list contains ORD-000124 and the returned basket line count is 0","when":"A staff user lists Received orders in the queue and the Buyer requests the basket"},{"given":"A valid basket with no note","id":"AC-44.3","level":"api","then":"The response status is 201 and the order note field is empty","when":"The Buyer submits the order"}],"ears":"When a valid order is submitted, the portal shall create an order with the next sequential prefixed order number, its lines at order-time unit prices, a copy of the delivery address, the delivery date, the optional note, status Received and a first timeline entry, and then empty the basket.","id":"REQ-44","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-1","I-4","I-13","ASM-25"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A set inactive","id":"AC-45.1","level":"api","then":"The response is a rejection status (422/409), the error says the company is inactive and no order record is created","when":"A staff user submits a new order for company A with valid lines"},{"given":"A Buyer whose session is still valid when the administrator deactivates them (race checked at submission)","id":"AC-45.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 401 or 403 and no order record is created","when":"The order submission is processed after deactivation"}],"ears":"If a user of an inactive customer company or a deactivated user submits an order, or staff try to create an order for an inactive customer company, then the portal shall reject it with an error and create no order.","id":"REQ-45","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","I-9","I-13","Q-5","Q-8"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order placed by Buyer Ann and confirmed by staff user Sam","id":"AC-46.1","level":"api","then":"The returned timeline list has 2 entries: 'Received' by Ann and 'Confirmed' by Sam, each with a timestamp","when":"The order is opened"}],"ears":"When an order changes status, the portal shall append a timeline entry recording the new status, the date and time, and the user who made the change or 'System'.","id":"REQ-46","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-8","I-14"],"stability":0.6666666666666666},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order placed by buyer@a.test","id":"AC-47.1","level":"api","then":"The confirmation email is sent to buyer@a.test only","when":"Staff confirm the order"},{"given":"An order created by staff for company A whose contact email is orders@a.test","id":"AC-47.2","level":"api","then":"The confirmation email is sent to orders@a.test and not to any Buyer","when":"Staff confirm the order"}],"ears":"The portal shall send each order email to the Buyer who placed the order, or to the customer company's contact email when staff created the order.","id":"REQ-47","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-4","I-14","ASM-17","ASM-33"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"Company A has 1 order by Buyer A1, 1 by Buyer A2 and 1 created by staff","id":"AC-48.1","level":"api","then":"The returned list has 3 rows, each with orderNumber, orderDate, deliveryDate, deliveryAddress, total and status fields","when":"Buyer A1 lists orders"},{"given":"Company A has one Delivered order by Buyer A2 and one Received order","id":"AC-48.2","level":"api","then":"The returned list contains only the Delivered order","when":"Buyer A1 lists orders filtered by status Delivered"}],"ears":"When a Buyer lists orders, the portal shall return every order of the Buyer's customer company, including orders placed by colleagues and by staff, with order number, order date, delivery date, delivery address, total and status, filterable by status and order date range.","id":"REQ-48","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-15","Q-2"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"An order whose quantity of BP-1001 was amended by staff from 4 to 2 and which was then confirmed","id":"AC-49.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200, the returned timeline has entries for Received and Confirmed with time and actor, and the amendments list has an entry showing BP-1001 changed from 4 to 2 with the staff user and time","when":"A Buyer of that company opens the order"},{"given":"An order containing a product that was later retired","id":"AC-49.2","level":"api","then":"The returned line still shows the product name, code and order-time unit price","when":"A Buyer opens the order"}],"ears":"When a Buyer of the order's company or a staff user opens an order, the portal shall return its number, order date, customer, delivery address, requested delivery date, current status, status timeline, lines with quantities, unit prices and line totals, order total, note and staff amendments.","id":"REQ-49","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-5","I-8","I-14","I-15"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Received order of company A placed by Buyer A2","id":"AC-50.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200, the order status value is Cancelled and the last timeline entry names Buyer A1","when":"Buyer A1 cancels it"},{"given":"A Received order created by staff for company A","id":"AC-50.2","level":"api","then":"The response status is 200 and the order status value is Cancelled","when":"Buyer A1 cancels it"}],"ears":"When a Buyer cancels an order of their own company that is in Received status, the portal shall set its status to Cancelled and add a timeline entry with the Buyer and time.","id":"REQ-50","op":"ADDED","sources":["I-15","Q-6"],"stability":1},{"acceptance":[{"given":"A Confirmed order of the Buyer's company","id":"AC-51.1","level":"api","then":"The response status is 409, the error message tells the Buyer to contact the distributor office and the status value stays Confirmed","when":"The Buyer cancels it"}],"ears":"If a Buyer tries to cancel an order that is not in Received status, then the portal shall reject the request wi